n\n店家也很有兒童友善，只要 12 歲以下可以使用 一蘭App就可以兌換一碗兒童拉麵。我們另外加點了一份麵和海苔，份量就更剛好了。\n\n一般拉麵一碗 310 元，湯頭依舊濃郁好喝，麵條口感也不錯。不過比較可惜的是，叉燒不是完整肉片，而是碎叉燒，吃起來會有一點「料不夠豐富」的感覺，和期待中的一蘭叉燒有些落差。\n\n整體來說，環境舒適、服務貼心，很適合親子用餐\n\n2026/08/05",null,[0,131]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2366897063041063437/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWZDJSWFNtOVNNRkY2VXpJMVZGSldTWGhOYmxKTVVsZDBjMHhZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2366897063041063437/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWZDJSWFNtOVNNRkY2VXpJMVZGSldTWGhOYmxKTVVsZDBjMHhZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2366897063041063437/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWZDJSWFNtOVNNRkY2VXpJMVZGSldTWGhOYmxKTVVsZDBjMHhZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2366897063041063437/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWZDJSWFNtOVNNRkY2VXpJMVZGSldTWGhOYmxKTVVsZDBjMHhZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2366897063041063437/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWZDJSWFNtOVNNRkY2VXpJMVZGSldTWGhOYmxKTVVsZDBjMHhZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2366897063041063437/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVWZDJSWFNtOVNNRkY2VXpJMVZGSldTWGhOYmxKTVVsZDBjMHhZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,4474,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Vd2RXSm9SMFF6UzI1VFJWSXhNblJMUld0c0xYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbe47e0c022a5a737!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnUwdWJoR0QzS25TRVIxMnRLRWtsLXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Vd2RXSm9SMFF6UzI1VFJWSXhNblJMUld0c0xYYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Vd2RXSm9SMFF6UzI1VFJWSXhNblJMUld0c0xYYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Vd2RXSm9SMFF6UzI1VFJWSXhNblJMUld0c0xYYxILMGVTOUFBQjBQMy0aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uVXdkV0pv